+/*
+ * 0398: the layers belong to the client that swaps them. Its close, or swaps from another client (a new
+ * render server while another process keeps the framebuffer open), turn every layer off first, so no
+ * layer of a dead render server stays on the panel or keeps its surface. SwapEnd / clientClose.
